# headwear/helm/plumed: PLUMED (open): a pointed helm with cheek guards under a tall plume (plume slot: a spray facing D, streaming back facing R / L).
# (FORGE-HEAD i1-i2, forge round 2: STYLE_P2 28.3, contracts 3c.1) the helm family `fam.plumed`, drawn once for both
# bodies (D10), lit from the top-left; regions R trim, P band, G socket gem, N seams and visor (glow at T6).
# i2 (the silhouette i1 panel: the families fell into ~8 blobs at 1x): redrawn so it adds its own shape OUTSIDE the head's outline.
# Written by FORGE-HEAD tools/gen_fam2.py + emit2.py (D and R drawn; L is R mirrored and re-lit; lie = L). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role helm fam.plumed
role helm form6
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
tags overlay
legend Q plume 0
legend S plume 1
legend T plume 2
legend U plume 3
legend X glow 3

view D key rest origin 2 4
mark crown 9 6
mark socket 9 5
