# (HELMS forge-fix i2) begin (forge fix 2, the owner: "plumed helms look alike at 1x; make the variants bolder"): `when
# helmfam-plumed,<mass>` replace views, one bold outline per body-mass class (the first replacing view that holds wins).
# the centurion: a transverse fan crest from ear to ear; the fountain: a tall spray on a stem that bursts both ways; the mohawk: a tall
# fore-and-aft brush over the crown, its tail down the back; the fall: a heavy plume over one side to the shoulder.
# Written by the HELMS area tools/d2.py (D R drawn; U is D with the face details dropped; L is R mirrored and re-lit).
